{c: Verse 1}
[G#m] [C#m],        Maanaa Ho Tum, Behad HaNsi
[D#] [G#m],        Aise Bure, Ham Bhii Nahii.N
[B] [C#m],        Dekho Kabhii To, Pyaar Se
